s[s] = 0;\n        Queue<Integer> q = new LinkedList<>();\n        q.offer(s);\n        inq[s] = 1;\n        cur = t;\n\n        while(!q.isEmpty()) {\n            int k = q.poll();\n            inq[k] = 0;\n            for (int x : head[k]) {\n                Edge e_x = e.get(x);\n                if (e_x.cap - e_x.flow == 0) continue;\n                int c = e_x.cost, y = e_x.to;\n                if (dis[y] > dis[k] + c) {\n                    dis[y] = dis[k] + c;\n                    p[y] = k;\n                    pe[y] = x;\n                    if (inq[y] == 0) {\n                        inq[y] = 1;\n                        q.offer(y);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        while(cur != s) {\n            e.get(pe[cur]).flow++;\n            e.get(pe[cur]^1).flow--;\n            cur = p[cur];\n        }\n        ans += dis[t];\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        StringTokenizer st;\n\n        st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n        n = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        m = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        k = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        c = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        d = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < maxn; i++) {\n            head[i].clear();\n        }\n\n        int sNode = s;\n        int tNode = t;\n\n        for (int i = 1; i <= k; i++) {\n            st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n            int x = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken()) - 1;\n            add_edge(sNode, x, 1, 0);\n        }\n        for (int i = 1; i <= 101; i++) {\n            add_edge((i - 1) * n, tNode, k, (long)(i - 1) * c);\n        }\n        for (int i = 1; i <= m; i++) {\n            st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n            int x = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken()) - 1;\n            int y = Integer.parseInt